<title>FRANCE: Alcatel falls after Thomson statement.</title>
<headline>Alcatel falls after Thomson statement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French telecommunications conglomerate Alcatel were lower on Wednesday after the French government said it was suspending the privatisation of Thomson SA.</p>
<p>The shares were off 2.80 percent at 461.80 francs after opening at 466 francs and trading as high as 471.80 francs earlier.</p>
</text>
